course: dictionary
lesson: 389
title: Meet the aphid
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: An aphid is a noun for a very small insect, often green or black, that sucks sap (juice) out of plants. You can find the meaning in the words around it. «Look at a rose stem covered in tiny green aphids sucking sweet sap.» The words tiny, green and sucking sweet sap are the clues: the aphids are small bugs feeding on the plant.
explain: The sentence «Park a car under a lime tree in July and come back to a windscreen covered in sticky drops» gives another clue. The sticky drops come from the aphids up in the leaves, which dribble sweet honeydew all afternoon. Ask yourself: what would fit in the sentence instead of aphids? A small insect would fit, so your meaning makes sense.
explain: People in the UK may call aphids greenfly or blackfly. When context is not enough, a dictionary settles it.
fact: An aphid is a very small insect that sucks the sap (juice) from plants.
fact: Aphids are often green or black.
fact: Aphids are also called greenfly or blackfly in the UK.
fact: In a food chain, aphids eat plant sap, and ladybirds, lacewings and birds eat aphids.
fact: Gardeners often see aphids as pests because they weaken plants.
exercise: «Look at a rose stem covered in tiny green aphids sucking sweet sap.» What is an aphid? | A very large fish that lives in ponds | *A very small insect that sucks sap from plants | A kind of soft bread | A type of rose with sharp thorns
exercise: Jo's gran calls them greenfly. What are greenfly? | *Aphids | Honeydew | Ladybirds | Lime trees
exercise: «Some ants guard aphids and stroke them for sweet honeydew.» What do the ants get from the aphids? | *Sweet honeydew | Green leaves to build the nest | Thorns from the rose | Ladybird eggs
test: Why do gardeners see aphids as pests? | Because they are very big and heavy | Because they make plants stronger | *Because they weaken plants | Because they make the leaves fall off in winter
test: Mark says aphids are big animals like dogs. What is wrong with his idea? | Aphids are birds that fly high | *Aphids are very small insects | Aphids live only in the sea | Aphids are fish
exam: Which of these is a food for ladybirds? | *Aphids | Rose petals | Windscreen drops | Lime flowers
